  "channel": "D04UP2L3E3S",
  "thread_ts": "1770961200.890407",
  "text": "Done. My call is on every issue in the LLC project and they're all moved. Plan sheet is in my drive, shared with you and Blake: https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1aGKRus4D3lXFzky7h_inmB72Na_dUc9fp6hAfPnLIEM/edit\n\nWhat I'd do:\n• **Combo Fighter** comes over, of course. Its AWS is $62/mo now that Blake killed the extra January backend copy. Blake moves the billing by Mar 1, and I take the game when Sunset's sale closes.\n• **Domino Delights** comes over too. It made $183.11 in January (warehouse daily revenue table), which covers the $140/mo its prod account bills now. Blake moves that billing by Mar 1, and you take the game through Sunset.\n• **Zombie Match** stays with HG. It made $0 in January, so it can't cover its own AWS.\n• AppsFlyer free tier for CF from March is on you. DD support is already on email.\n• Blake already carries Metabase $100, dbt $100 and GitHub $48 on his card through May.\n• Everything else stays with HG: the AWS dev/ZM/analytics accounts, build machines, Figma, Calm Play, and everything we already kept or cancelled in #winddown.\n\nCost March–May: **$450/mo total**, so **$150/mo each**. Blake's $248 counts toward his third. You and I each put in $150 cash a month. That covers the LLC's $202 in AWS and pays Blake back the $98 he's over."
